(Other Speaker) But this is like the original original,

30
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:42,519
(Other Speaker) where they have the trees of civilization.

31
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:46,680
(Other Speaker) Not like where the first man was found,

32
